@trait {
  name: "@ambisonics",
  category: "audio",
  description: "Higher-order ambisonic (HOA) encoder and decoder for full-sphere 360° spatial audio in VR, XR, and cinematic pipelines. order selects the spherical harmonic order used for the ambisonic field representation: first uses 4 channels (W/X/Y/Z) covering the B-format signal and is sufficient for most VR experiences; second uses 9 channels for improved frontal localisation; third uses 16 channels providing near-HRTF angular accuracy at the cost of higher decode CPU. format specifies the channel layout and normalisation convention of the ambisonic bus: ambix (AmbiX) encodes channels in ACN ordering with SN3D normalisation and is the de-facto standard for spatial audio interchange and web browsers via WebAudio; fuma (FuMa) encodes in W-X-Y-Z ordering with MaxN normalisation for compatibility with legacy DAW toolchains and some head-tracking hardware. rotation_tracking when true reads the listener's head pose from the XR runtime or device IMU and applies a real-time yaw/pitch/roll rotation matrix to the ambisonic field each audio frame, so the soundscape stays world-locked as the listener turns their head; when false the field is fixed in listener space (useful for music or non-diegetic content). head_lock when true fixes the ambisonic field to the listener's head orientation regardless of rotation_tracking — equivalent to disabling yaw compensation; intended for headphone-specific content mixed without head tracking. near_field when true activates a near-field high-frequency correction filter that compensates for the inter-aural level and phase differences of sources closer than 1 metre, producing more accurate localisation for sounds at arm's length or nearer. on_decode fires when the HOA decode pipeline is initialised or reconfigured, carrying order, format, and channel count. on_rotate fires each frame that a head-tracking rotation matrix is applied, carrying the euler angles. on_error fires on decoder failure, unsupported format, or source load error. Research: AmbisonicsTrait.ts v2.0 — CIPIC rotation matrix, ACN/FuMa channel map, binaural decode, HRTFTrait.ts, EnvironmentalAudioTrait.ts.",
  props: {
    order: enum("first" | "second" | "third") = "first",
    format: enum("ambix" | "fuma") = "ambix",
    rotation_tracking: boolean = true,
    head_lock: boolean = false,
    near_field: boolean = false
  },
  events: {
    attached: "ambisonics:attached",
    detached: "ambisonics:detached",
    ready: "ambisonics:ready",
    on_decode: "ambisonics:decode",
    on_rotate: "ambisonics:rotate",
    on_error: "ambisonics:error",
    source_loaded: "ambisonics:source_loaded",
    playback_started: "ambisonics:playback_started",
    playback_stopped: "ambisonics:playback_stopped",
    on_play: "ambisonics:play",
    on_stop: "ambisonics:stop",
    on_set_order: "ambisonics:set_order",
    on_set_format: "ambisonics:set_format"
  },
  behaviors: ["@hrtf", "@environmental_audio"]
}
